{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa Starts Dating Marco"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Are You Free?"}, {"type": "position", "content": 1}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 9}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe characteristics of different people and their jobs."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le09ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Asking If or When People are Free"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you want to spend time with someone, you ask them if or when they are free."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use these phrases to ask people if or when they are free:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "I am/was wondering if ...<br /> Are you free on/in ... ?<br /> How does (day) sound?<br /> When are you free to ... ?<br /> What day are you free on?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I was wondering if you wanted to go to the park. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Are you free in the morning? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "How does Sunday sound? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "When are you free to get some ice cream?"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " The First Conditional"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You can use the first conditional to talk about actions and situations in the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "There are two parts to the sentence. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "One part is the <span class =\"strong\">condition</span>. The other part is the <span class =\"strong\">result</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Form:<br /><span class=\"italic\"> If + subject + Simple Present tense  + subject + will</span><br />  You use a comma after the condition in this form. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can flip the two parts of the sentence so that the result comes first.  It can be in interrogative form. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Form:<br /><span class=\"italic\"> Will + subject + if + subject + Simple Present tense ?</span>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Condition </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\">Result</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> If we don't go, </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I will send you a text. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Result </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Condition </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Will you text me  </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> when you arrive at the park? </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "weather forecast"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a description of what kind of weather is likely to happen in the future "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The weather forecast for tomorrow looks great."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le09ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about activities you can do outside."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "playground"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an area that often has special equipment for kids to play on "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We can visit the playground in the park."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le09ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to feed"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to give food to "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I love feeding the little birds."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le09ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "goose "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a bird that is like a duck but larger"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Do you want to feed the goose by the pond?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le09ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "depends on "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "directly affected or decided by another thing"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My answer depends on what you choose."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le09ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "petting zoo"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an area which has farm animals in it for people to touch "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I love going to the petting zoo to see the horses."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le09ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "swing"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a seat hanging from ropes or chains "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I love to play on the swings at the playground."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le09ob01aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to swing"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to make a swing move backwards and forwards "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  How high can you swing?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le09ob01aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "winner"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person that did the best in a game  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Who will be the winner of the competition tonight?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le09ob01aud09"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Pretend that you and your friend want to do an activity together."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a short dialogue (7-8 lines) between you and your friend. You have to decide on an activity to do, when to do it and where to go."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your dialogue aloud with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your partner's dialogue aloud."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about free time activities."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask when people are free."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about events in the future."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le09ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le09ob01re2img06.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le09ob01re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Marco</span>: Looking at the weather forecast, looks like a beautiful day tomorrow.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I was just going to text you. Are you free to attend a party next week?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Marco</span>: Might be, depending on who's asking.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Just a girl I know.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le09ob01re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Marco</span>: Hm, I'll think about it. So, I'm wondering if you have some free time tomorrow? If you do, we can take a walk in the park ... visit the playground.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I may g